  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Driver Final Answer Key 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-26T19:24:48+05:30\">May 26, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">7:24 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Final Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Delhi Police Driver&nbsp;Examination 2025.</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>Exam</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">was conducted on<strong> 16 – 17 December 2025</strong></span><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>SSC</strong>&nbsp;application process started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\">24 September 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\">15 October 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Final Answer Key </strong>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Driver Final Answer Key 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Driver Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-delhi-police-driver-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Start Date : <strong>24 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date : <strong>15 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>16 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>31 October – 02 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>16 – 17 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>14 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>31 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Slot Selection Starting Date&nbsp;<strong>: 05 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Slot Selection Last Date&nbsp;<strong>: 10 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>29 April 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>SSC Delhi Police </strong>official website.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General, OBC, EWS </strong>:&nbsp;<strong>₹ 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC, ST, PWD Candidates</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong>₹&nbsp;</strong><strong><span class=\"blue bold\">00/-</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>&nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Driver Notification 2025 : Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Delhi</strong> <strong>Police Driver </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">660 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Driver Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details </h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Delhi Police Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">660</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Delhi Police Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidate must have passed the <strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"206\">10+2 (Intermediate) examination</strong> from a recognized board or institution. In addition to the educational qualification, the candidate should possess a valid <strong>Heavy Motor Vehicle (HMV) Driving License</strong>, issued by a competent authority. Both conditions—academic qualification and driving license—are mandatory to be considered eligible for the post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;SSC Delhi Police Driver Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility Details&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">07 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">12.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.6 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">08 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">11.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.3 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Above 40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">09 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.0 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download SSC Delhi Police Driver Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"226\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official website</strong> of</span><br data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"181\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Staff Selection Commission</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywfl8p\" data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"281\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, go to the <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"271\">“Results”</strong> section</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18xygi9\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"313\">“Delhi Police”</strong> tab</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"uu6hd0\" data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"371\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Find and click on</span><br data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"344\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"371\">“Driver Result 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dhxcgi\" data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"416\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The result will open in <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"414\">PDF format</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ddjt4x\" data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"482\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Press <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"439\">Ctrl + F</strong> and search your:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"482\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1cb4ou\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"482\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Roll Number / Name</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q3etge\" data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"535\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">If your details appear → <strong data-st